      "content": "I'm sorry, but I'm a bit confused. Why on earth did you refer to my team of engineers—or the border officials—as \"mischievous goblins\"? \n\nThat's a very strange and unprofessional way to describe a high-stakes corporate trip. Also, you cut off again at the end of your list. Could you please finish your point about flexibility, and can you please stick to the actual professional logistics? I need practical advice for my management report, not metaphors about goblins and ropes.",
